o waste their lives posting \u201cIsrael bad, man!\u201d\n\nSome of these same idiots on the right will rightly talk about Muslims taking over the world. Then they turn around and clutch their pearls because we bombed some Muslim terrorists.\n\nThe whole thing makes no sense. I can only assume this is all a foreign disinformation psyop. It seems targeted especially at zoomers, via Chinese TikTok. Zoomers are all retarded and they will repeat anything that gets them attention, views, follows and likes.\n\nThere are also clearly shills pushing the propaganda on this very site. They use alts and manipulate upvotes and try to consensus crack by pretending their numbers are far greater than they are. When I say that, I\u2019m not guessing. I guarantee it is true.\n\nThe whole situation is a mess. America is losing a propaganda war badly. I\u2019m not sure what to do. We should start by banning TikTok. One of Trump\u2019s biggest mistakes was not banning TikTok. ", "author": "EnforceRuleOne", "created": 1793857114094, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Smurfection", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The Iran War proves America is doomed ", "last_comment_created": 1793874907780, "content": "<p>Such a ridiculous mass trooning out reaction to the what has been a very minor and justified conflict.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Iran has killed thousands of our troops</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Iran constantly attacks our allies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Iran threatens us day after day, chanting \u201cdeath to America\u201d regularly</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Iran tried to kill Trump</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Iran tried to get a nuclear bomb</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Trump stopped them</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>almost no Americans died</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>gas went up 50 cents</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is the entire story. But listening to the retards tell the story, both on the right and left</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Trump DESTROYED our economy for no reason because he\u2019d CONTROLLED by the (((lizard people))). He got us into WW3! We are all going to die!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>There\u2019s no way our country can last being this delusional and faggoty. The modern American electorate wouldn\u2019t last a day during WW2, acting like a 50 cent gas price increase is some Jesus-like sacrifice.</p>\n<p>I don\u2019t even think these idiots believe what they\u2019re saying. They just think it\u2019s cool or something to waste their lives posting \u201cIsrael bad, man!\u201d</p>\n<p>Some of these same idiots on the right will rightly talk about Muslims taking over the world. Then they turn around and clutch their pearls because we bombed some Muslim terrorists.</p>\n<p>The whole thing makes no sense. I can only assume this is all a foreign disinformation psyop. It seems targeted especially at zoomers, via Chinese TikTok. Zoomers are all retarded and they will repeat anything that gets them attention, views, follows and likes.</p>\n<p>There are also clearly shills pushing the propaganda on this very site. They use alts and manipulate upvotes and try to consensus crack by pretending their numbers are far greater than they are. When I say that, I\u2019m not guessing. I guarantee it is true.</p>\n<p>The whole situation is a mess. America is losing a propaganda war badly. I\u2019m not sure what to do. We should start by banning TikTok. One of Trump\u2019s biggest mistakes was not banning TikTok.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 26, "score_up": 54, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "ar